description "Rebel Saboteur

Elite agents armed with tools to bring the opposition down from the inside.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 75% more damage
-- 20% slower RoF
-- Heavyweight
- Requisitioned Repeater (Blaster Rifle 1)
-- 30% faster RoF
-- 15% less damage
-- 10% slower reload

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Force Sense Immunity
- Tracking Beacon
- 10% faster hacking
- 100% slower skill cooldown"